# Run yarn tester first. Set the PR and optional wallet in the REST Client environment.
@base = http://localhost:5500
@pr = {{$processEnv DEFRAME_PREVIEW_PR}}
@pixWallet = {{$processEnv TESTER_EVM_ADDRESS}}

### 1 pix-brl → usdc-gnosis
GET {{base}}/v2/swap/quote?originChain=fiat&tokenIn=BRL&amountIn=100&destinationChain=gnosis&tokenOut=0x2a22f9c3b484c3629090FeED35F17Ff8F88f76F0&preferredProvider=pods&destinationAddress={{pixWallet}}
x-preview-quote: {{pr}}

### 1 pix-brl → usdt0-stable
GET {{base}}/v2/swap/quote?originChain=fiat&tokenIn=BRL&amountIn=100&destinationChain=stable&tokenOut=0x779Ded0c9e1022225f8E0630b35a9b54bE713736&preferredProvider=pods&destinationAddress={{pixWallet}}
x-preview-quote: {{pr}}

### 1 brla-polygon → usdc-gnosis
GET {{base}}/v2/swap/quote?originChain=polygon&tokenIn=0xE6A537a407488807F0bbeb0038B79004f19DDDFb&amountIn=1000000000000000000&destinationChain=gnosis&tokenOut=0x2a22f9c3b484c3629090FeED35F17Ff8F88f76F0&preferredProvider=pods
x-preview-quote: {{pr}}

